			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761230101,
					"content": "好香的味道，又遇上哥伦比娅的用餐时间了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230102,
					"content": "月灵们…正在一个个排队，盛汤的是哥伦比娅！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230103,
					"content": "稍等一下哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230104,
					"content": "~！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "月灵"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230105,
					"content": "哇，这个好喝欸…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230106,
					"content": "清香爽口的甜果子汤，是在别的地方没喝过的味道！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230107,
					"content": "再来一碗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230108,
					"content": "两碗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230109,
					"content": "……！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "努昂诺塔"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230110,
					"content": "哥伦比娅最近在学习烹饪？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230111,
					"content": "嗯，我问伊涅芙要了些基础菜谱，已经尝试了几次。月灵和小动物们的反响都不错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230112,
					"content": "有遇到什么难点吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230113,
					"content": "唔，袖子太宽了，一不小心就会沾到锅边…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230114,
					"content": "（原来不是烹饪本身的困难啊。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230115,
					"content": "不过，在制作点心类食物的时候，会有些应付不来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230116,
					"content": "它们对于温度和比例的要求很严格…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230117,
					"content": "（看来她以前很少自己做东西吃。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230118,
					"content": "（而且点心类的料理，如果只靠自己摸索的话，的确会不容易…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230119,
					"content": "要我来帮你吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230120,
					"content": "好呀。先从蛋卷开始吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230121,
					"content": "一段时间过后…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230122,
					"content": "尝尝看？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230123,
						761230124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230123,
					"content": "（咬一小口。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230125
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230125,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230126,
					"content": "（第一口好酸啊，感觉脸都快皱到一起了…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230127,
					"content": "（但稍微咽下去一点，甜味就重新出现了…可能习惯之后会好些…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230128
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230128,
					"content": "怎么样？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230129,
						761230130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230129,
					"content": "合格…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230131
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230131,
					"content": "我错过了什么吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230132,
					"content": "派蒙，快来尝尝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230133,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230134,
					"content": "呜哇哇哇，好酸啊，你们欺负人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230135,
					"content": "哈哈…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230136,
					"content": "回味还是不错的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230137
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230137,
					"content": "重点是一开始啊！根本没人提醒我要少咬它一点！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230138,
					"content": "你不说的话，我还以为你想搞恶作剧呢，看别人吃的反应什么的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230139,
					"content": "好吧，我再试试。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230140,
					"content": "又一段时间过后…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230141
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230141,
					"content": "给，试试看这次的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230142,
					"content": "（唔…！这次的好多了！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230143,
						761230144
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230143,
					"content": "这次的真好吃！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230145
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230145,
					"content": "真的吗？我也要我也要！唔…！这个好这个好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230146,
					"content": "能送得出手吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230147
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230147,
					"content": "当然可以！哦，哥伦比娅你学烹饪，做蛋卷，是想要给谁准备礼物吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230148
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230148,
					"content": "嗯…想送给朋友们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230149
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230149,
					"content": "挺好的主意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230150
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230150,
					"content": "还记得你们第一次一起来这边的时候吗？你们为我准备了一些饭菜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230151
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230151,
					"content": "与我流失的力量相比，食物没法提供多少补充，但在吃完之后，我的内心却舒缓了不少。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230152
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230152,
					"content": "虽然那时没有细想其中的缘由，但现在我已经明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230153
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230153,
					"content": "亲手制作，用心付出…赋予食物灵魂的是人们所花费的时间。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230154
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230154,
					"content": "我享用的不是饭菜本身，而是背后那双手中的温暖与善意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230155
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230155,
					"content": "它越是不求回报，便越是珍贵，唯有同等的温暖与善意才能与它辉映。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230156
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230156,
					"content": "哎呀，说得我都不好意思了，我们那时候还是挺想讨好你的呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230157,
						761230158
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230157,
					"content": "不过现在不一样了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230159
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230159,
					"content": "嗯，但在理解这些之后，我也想多付出一点…感觉很开心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230160
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230160,
					"content": "可以和我一起出门拜访朋友们吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230161
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230161,
					"content": "除了蛋卷，我还准备了一些别的小礼物。哦，不过，是悄悄地送哟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230162
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230162,
					"content": "为什么是「悄悄地」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230163
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230163,
					"content": "以前都是你们给我「惊喜」，我也想看看朋友们收到「惊喜」时的反应。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230164
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230164,
					"content": "呼，跑了好多地方呢，终于送完了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230165
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230165,
					"content": "大家的反应都有些意想不到呢，虽然有的人好像根本没有意识到这是哥伦比娅的礼物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230166
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230166,
					"content": "爱诺只顾着吃了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230167
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230167,
					"content": "没事，这也在我的预期之中。只要朋友们收到礼物时开心就好，这才是最重要的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230168
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230168,
					"content": "这么说的话，菈乌玛看起来倒是发现了她桌上的蛋卷和花环是哥伦比娅送的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230169
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230169,
					"content": "花环舍不得戴我倒是能理解，但那个蛋卷…她足足看了十分钟都没舍得吃呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230170
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230170,
					"content": "都怕她要供起来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230171
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230171,
					"content": "但雅珂达好像被吓了一跳…是不是不该悄悄把东西放到她身后呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230172
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230172,
					"content": "真的吓了一「跳」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230173
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230173,
					"content": "可能她本身就比较警觉吧。但在阿舍鲁过来挠你送的猫抓板后，她好像就冷静下来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230174
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230174,
					"content": "其他最近不在挪德卡莱的朋友，就拜托你们送去啦。",
