					"content": "嗯…很好吃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230183
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230183,
					"content": "那就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230184
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230184,
					"content": "还有一份。给你的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230185
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230185,
					"content": "这是…风之翼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230186
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230186,
					"content": "我听说天空属于飞鸟，陆地属于走兽…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230187
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230187,
					"content": "而天与地之间的广阔间隔，是留给身披风之翼的冒险家穿梭的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230188
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230188,
					"content": "希望在有它相伴的日子里，你的前路始终会像被月光照拂那般明朗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230189
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230189,
					"content": "我很喜欢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761230190
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761230190,
					"content": "谢谢你的陪伴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761230182,
					"content": "比祈月之夜的糖果更好吃。",
